| <div style="position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column;" class="pc-flex-row"><div class="relative float-left mx-6"><div class="-rotate-3 m-3">[[File:v2a1_strangetale_ending2_6.png|180px|link=]]</div><div class="absolute serif right-0 bottom-0 drop-shadow">[[File:V2a1_strangetale_assessment_c.png|64px|link=]]</div></div><div style="text-indent: 2em; align-self: center; margin-right: 3px;">“一个人敲响了她的车窗：‘开门，例行检查！’ <div> “原来后车司机是一名便衣警察。女人就是就是电台里报道的绑架犯，由于被警察看到了后座的人影，她落网了。”</div></div>
